.git
.github
.idea
.expo
.husky
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Never bake secrets or local state into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
dump.rdb

# Mobile app build output - the server image does not need it
android
ios
packages/app/android
packages/app/ios

# Test / report artefacts
**/jest-coverage
**/jest-html-report
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local mkcert material - never belongs in a build context
**/*.pem
**/certs
